<title>USA: Centura acquisition deal is terminated.</title>
<headline>Centura acquisition deal is terminated.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centura Software Corp said Friday that its agreement to acquire privately held InfoSpinner has been terminated.</p>
<p>Centura said that because it had not obtained a majority vote of its shareholders required to approve the deal, InfoSpinner exercised its right to terminate the agreement, which was announced in January.</p>
<p>Although the acquisition did not go through, Centura said it will retain its worldwide distribution rights to InfoSpinner's ForeSite web integration server.</p>
